close_reason: "beforeMutation guards receive a frozen actor block resolved from the mutation's own author, plus dry_run; previews judge guards as dry runs; imports and copies are guarded"
contract_change:
  api: "SDK BeforeMutationHookContext, runActiveBeforeMutationHooks, runRegisteredMutationGuardForTest, previewItemMutations (unresolved_commit_constraints), commitImportedItem, pm copy"
  before: "Guard contexts carried no actor or dry_run; runActiveBeforeMutationHooks took a prebuilt context; previews ran no guards and disclosed extension_mutation_guards_and_hooks; package imports and pm copy wrote without guards, and commitImportedItem turned every CONFLICT into a conflictWarning"
  after: "Guard contexts carry a frozen actor {author, author_source, principal, agent?} and dry_run; runActiveBeforeMutationHooks takes author (and optional dry_run) and resolves the actor; previews evaluate guards as dry runs and disclose extension_write_hooks; imports (operation import) and copies are guarded, and only a held lock is a skippable import conflict"
  migrate: "Hosts that call runActiveBeforeMutationHooks pass author instead of building a context; consumers matching unresolved_commit_constraints read extension_write_hooks; guards with side effects check dry_run; importers treat a guard denial from commitImportedItem as a refusal, not a lock conflict"
escape_class: production_defect
